    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes discrete profile data collected during the R/V \u00c3\u0081ngeles Alvarino TALPRO cruise (EXPOCODE 29AJ20160818) in the Mediterranean Sea from 2016-08-18 to 2016-08-29. These data include dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC), total alkalinity, pH on total scale at 25\u00c2\u00baC, chlorofluorocarbon 12 (CFC-12), sulfur hexaflouride (SF6), temperature, salinity, dissolved oxygen, silicate, nitrate+nitrite and phosphate.",
